{
  "uid": "api-client-telemetry",
  "title": "Clients' telemetry",
  "description": "Whether the telemetry of users' clients reaches the stores: how the batches that the telemetry proxy takes end, how many bytes it forwards, and what the collector refuses or fails to pass on of them. And what the clients measured of their own requests (the client_telemetry spec).",
  "tags": [
    "api",
    "area"
  ],
  "editable": false,
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "API overview",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/api-overview",
      "keepTime": true,
      "targetBlank": false,
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "tags": [],
      "asDropdown": false,
      "includeVars": false,
      "tooltip": ""
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "How do the clients' batches end?",
      "description": "The batches that the telemetry proxy's three routes answered in the last 5 minutes, by status and error code: 200 for a batch that the collector took, 403 client_telemetry.consent_required for a user who doesn't consent, 429 request.rate_limited for a rate limit or a budget, and 400 client_telemetry.batch_refused or 503 client_telemetry.collector_unavailable for a batch that the collector refused or didn't take (CLIENT_TELEMETRY-004 to CLIENT_TELEMETRY-010). \"Which rate limits refuse requests?\" on the API platform dashboard tells a user's budget from a replica's.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (http_response_status_code, error_type) (increase(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_route=~\"/v1/users/me/telemetry/(traces|logs|metrics)\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_response_status_code}} {{error_type}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "How many bytes of clients' telemetry does each replica forward a minute?",
      "description": "The bytes a minute, inflated, of the batches that the collector took from each replica, over the last 5 minutes. A replica forwards at most its budget, CLIENT_TELEMETRY_REPLICA_BYTES_PER_MINUTE, in each minute (CLIENT_TELEMETRY-008).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (instance) (rate(client_telemetry_forwarded_bytes_total[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "How many bytes of each signal do the stores take in a minute?",
      "description": "The bytes a minute, inflated, of the batches that the collector took from every replica together, by signal, over the last 5 minutes: what the clients' telemetry adds to Tempo, Loki and the collector's sums of the clients' metrics, before each stores it in its own format (CLIENT_TELEMETRY-013).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (client_telemetry_signal) (rate(client_telemetry_forwarded_bytes_total[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{client_telemetry_signal}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Is the collector refusing or failing to pass on the clients' telemetry?",
      "description": "Items per second that the collector's receiver of clients' batches refused, as when the memory limit of the clients' pipelines is reached, which the telemetry proxy answers with 503, and items per second that the clients' exporters failed to send to their stores.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_refused_spans_total{receiver=\"otlp/clients\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "refused: spans"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_refused_log_records_total{receiver=\"otlp/clients\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "refused: log records"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_refused_metric_points_total{receiver=\"otlp/clients\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "refused: metric points"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (exporter) (rate(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_spans_total{exporter=~\".+_clients\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{exporter}}: spans"
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (exporter) (rate(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_log_records_total{exporter=~\".+_clients\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{exporter}}: log records"
        },
        {
          "refId": "F",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (exporter) (rate(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_metric_points_total{exporter=~\".+_clients\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{exporter}}: metric points"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "How do the clients' requests end?",
      "description": "The requests that users' clients measured, in the last 5 minutes, added up over every installation, by client, by the response's status, and, for a request that got none, by error_type: timeout, connection_error, or _OTHER for any other (CLIENT_TELEMETRY-014, CLIENT_TELEMETRY-015). A client reports these numbers itself, so they inform, and no alert reads them.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (job, http_response_status_code, error_type) (increase(http_client_request_duration_seconds_count[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} {{http_response_status_code}} {{error_type}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "How long do the clients wait for their requests?",
      "description": "How long the typical request and the slowest one in a hundred took, as users' clients measured them, over every installation and the last 5 minutes, by client (CLIENT_TELEMETRY-014).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (job, le) (rate(http_client_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} typical"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (job, le) (rate(http_client_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} slowest 1%"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      }
    }
  ]
}
